WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
(upbeat sitar music)

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.940
- [Narrator] In Northern Bangladesh,

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:04.400
just below the Himalayas, there's a school

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.140
unlike any you've probably seen.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.140
Rather than brick-and-mortar buildings,

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:10.730
these classrooms float.

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:13.563
(kids chattering)

00:00:17.561 --> 00:00:20.040
(contemplative percussion
and chimes music)

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:22.570
In most of Bangladesh, the roads are poor,

00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:24.890
and the environment is powerful.

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:28.000
Every year, over a fifth
of the country floods,

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.920
isolating people in small villages

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.823
and cutting kids off from school.

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:36.030
So a man named Mohammed
Rezwan had an idea.

00:00:55.539 --> 00:00:58.372
(engine rumbling)

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.550
(water splashes)

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:11.670
- [Narrator] There are different boats

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:13.200
with different purposes.

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.860
There are classroom boats, library boats,

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:18.623
boats for computers,
and even ones for play.

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:23.650
In groups of 30, kids aged
six to 10 attend classes

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:26.703
covering the main points of
early childhood education.

00:01:46.569 --> 00:01:48.350
- [Narrator] With millions
of children out of school

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:50.660
in Bangladesh, these kids are getting

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:53.080
a chance that many others don't-

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:56.543
a chance to learn and
hopefully change their lives.

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:28.383
(reflective wooden chimes music)

00:02:32.146 --> 00:02:35.813
(contemplative synth music)

